<title>USA: Barr Laboratories Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Barr Laboratories Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, N.Y. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			     December 31,	   December 31,</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales	  $67,335     $57,465    $131,566    $111,641</p>
<p>Earnings from</p>
<p>  operations	  3,158	 2,962	 5,859	 6,375</p>
<p>Earnings before</p>
<p>  income taxes	3,554	 3,136	 6,391	 6,744</p>
<p>Income tax expense</p>
<p>			  1,326	 1,147	 2,396	 2,554</p>
<p> Net earnings	 2,228	 1,989	 3,995	 4,190</p>
<p>PER COMMON SHARE:</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>  primary share	0.15	  0.14	  0.27	  0.30</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p>assuming full dilution</p>
<p>			   0.15	  0.14	  0.27	  0.29</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>		   14,803,000  13,958,040  14,782,000  13,949,218</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares assuming full</p>
<p>  dilution     14,803,000  14,515,176  14,814,000  14,506,354</p>
<p>(thousands of dollars except share amounts)</p>
<p>Per share data give retroactive effect to 3-for-2 stock split effective March 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
